on-arrival: party_policy_paramilitary = 0; revolutionaries_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 6; agrarnians_dissent += 4; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 6; reformist_dissent -= 10; democratization += 2; radicalization -= 2; pacifism += 1;

republic

-@the: Continue to the congress

# THEORY =---------------------------------------

@the

congress start

= Class Theory Queation 

-@rural: The peasnts and farmers are as much proletarian as a steelworker or bus driver and should be concidered as such by our party!
-@prolet: We shall remain the party of the urban proletariat in its primacy.
-@midlle: Maybe we can try to transform our party into a wider "people's party" represneting all social groups who arent burgoise?
-@people_create: We can officialy become a People's Party, that will represent all of the non-burgoise society!
-@people_support: We remain commited to the Socialist people's party. 

@people_support
view-if: united_front_theory == 2 
on-arrival: united_front_theory = 2; revolutionaries_dissent += 8; left_dissent += 6; agrarnians_dissent += 4; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 6; reformist_dissent -= 6;

