view-if: united_front_theory != 2
choose-if: (cen_seats + lef_seats/2) > (agr_seats + rev_seats)
on-arrival: united_front_theory = 0; revolutionaries_dissent -= 2; left_dissent -= 2; agrarnians_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent -= 2; reformist_dissent += 4;

