-@land: Continue to the congress

# LAND ---------------------------------------------------------------------

@land

congress start

= Issue of the Land policy and the rural Question. 

-@land_0: The peasnts and farmers struggle should be on our forefront and their fight for emancipation is our goal!
-@land_3: The party supports the new colectivation plans as a way to achive Socialism in the countryside. 
-@land_2: Continue the current policy of supporting the rural struggle against the landowners, but do not focus on their issues.
-@land_1: Rural affairs should not concern the party of the urban Proletariat.

@land_3
choose-if: ((cen_seats + ref_seats) < (agr_seats + rev_seats + lef_seats/2 + lab_seats/2)) and asum_formed == 0 
on-arrival: party_policy_land = 2; revolutionaries_dissent -= 4; left_dissent -= 2; agrarnians_dissent -= 8; labor_dissent -= 2; center_dissent += 6; reformist_dissent += 6;

party

-@regional: Continue the congress

@land_2
on-arrival: party_policy_land = 1; revolutionaries_dissent -= 2; left_dissent += 4; agrarnians_dissent -= 4; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent -= 2; reformist_dissent -= 6;

quo 

-@regional: Continue to the congress

@land_1
choose-if: (agr_seats + rev_seats/2) < cen_seats
on-arrival: party_policy_land = 0; revolutionaries_dissent += 4; left_dissent += 6; agrarnians_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent += 6;

